  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): instance of the silent-CLI-accept umbrella INV-fabov-kapit-mupit-tigoz; matches the umbrella's mechanic-statement exactly (\"a search subcommand silently accepting invalid filter values\"). Six siblings already parent under INV-fabov (INV-gufod, INV-nonag, INV-gobob, INV-jibof, INV-nufob, INV-votop, WI-vusaf, INV-mofih). Should set parent=INV-fabov-kapit-mupit-tigoz-lurol-mulus-jivik-kajun. Fix-class identical: argparse choices= or a post-parse validator against the seven section names enumerated in cli.py:5906-5907's help text."  # 7539
